  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this study is to better understand who is most vulnerable in Afghanistan and how can they be supported through humanitarian and wider assistance provided by FCDO, including CSSF. The outputs from this work will inform future strategies and plans for FCDO development work in Afghanistan.</narrative>
